# Park the arm at the remembered "hide" teach point (trajectories.json) —
# 100% out of the camera's view. Served by cobot_operation, never
# cobot_control directly: task_manager (pick_layer) sends this before every
# scan instead of talking to cobot_control itself, so the move goes through
# the same tool/trajectory ownership and busy-lock serialization as
# /cobot/pick_can.
#
# Rejected (goal not accepted) if no "hide" point is configured yet
# (/cobot/set_teach_point adds one) or the stored positions don't match the
# active tool (same gate as /cobot/pick_can).
#
# Cancel policy: IMMEDIATE, same as /cobot/pick_can — the in-flight
# MoveToPose is canceled (controller MotionStop).
---
bool success
string message
---
